from our platform and capabilities. Yext enables businesses to:","section":"Item 1. Business","block":70,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-016402","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-10","reportDate":"2026-01-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026016402/yext-20260131.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/d852300d4a91e1b1200e6ff31397b2b3fb5711c61411518ea6fa94e6d86827d0.bin","sha256":"d852300d4a91e1b1200e6ff31397b2b3fb5711c61411518ea6fa94e6d86827d0"}},{"id":"9cda76d204d88d221b73166426467ea46c7c922576bd6d1a62de274c515a7c72","quote":"•increase local engagement by ensuring all publishers have accurate information about their business;","context":"•manage a consistent brand experience across all digital channels;","section":"Item 1. Business","block":71,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-016402","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-10","reportDate":"2026-01-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026016402/yext-20260131.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/d852300d4a91e1b1200e6ff31397b2b3fb5711c61411518ea6fa94e6d86827d0.bin","sha256":"d852300d4a91e1b1200e6ff31397b2b3fb5711c61411518ea6fa94e6d86827d0"}},{"id":"6bcf7743e6d0c220a2692c36805690802a7e4123eef5b5412b0781deabddeb42","quote":"•access one platform for all digital marketing channels, with the ability to integrate with their existing marketing solutions and consolidate marketing data;","context":"•increase local engagement by ensuring all publishers have accurate information about their business;","section":"Item 1. Business","block":72,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-016402","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-10","reportDate":"2